id=evergo-jump
name=Evergo UEFI Jump
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=evergo-uefi-port
description=Launch the evergo UEFI firmware from a home-screen icon. Copies the bundled FD into reserved DRAM and branches into it without touching any partition. Requires root (this is a Magisk module). A failed attempt is recovered by power-cycling.
